  "system": {
    "description": "<section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block scrpg-archetype-block-intro\"><p>You are the brute squad.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Powers/Qualities</div><p>Assign one of the dice you rolled at the end of the power source step to the @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.DK1Dj4AZrwDMvF9G]{Strength} power. If you already have @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.DK1Dj4AZrwDMvF9G]{Strength}, either skip it or swap the die with one of your new dice.</p><p>Assign one of the remaining dice to any of these powers:</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.D8wlyytUDg2oEbkx]{Density Control}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.fBd3ZqSIUowckCHO]{Leaping}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.fubw8CJu2mXFZJUD]{Signature Weaponry}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.N9hlUuhKZTN6REox]{Size-Changing}</p><p>• Select from Athletic powers category</p><p>Assign any remaining dice to any of these qualities:</p><p>• Select from Physical qualities category</p><p>• Select from Social qualities category</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Abilities</div><p>Gain two of the following Green abilities, each using a different power or quality from the Physical Powerhouse list (including @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.DK1Dj4AZrwDMvF9G]{Strength}):</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.IPB6eWZFzzDr9j8e]{Damage Resistant}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.HvsVJwjnaH7rWRtR]{Frontline Fighting}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.FCVqKVJ3wJ2eoJJi]{Galvanize}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.dH37lJqo53cKcBFQ]{Power Strike}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.cZZWLhJRhEtQDP1L]{Strength in Victory}</li></ul><p>Gain one of the above abilities at Yellow, using a different power or quality than your Green abilities.</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.CTVnGKdSvggWJVxE]{Damage Resistant}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.ORy7E29N09dz6B9s]{Frontline Fighting}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.oBQ6K4S07DFRgLN2]{Galvanize}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.BcQLMN3FChkKxVeM]{Power Strike}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.5zeLBXXVOL4mm937]{Strength in Victory}</li></ul></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Principle</div><p>Choose an Expertise principle.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Personality</div><p>Roll d10, d10 for personality selection.</p></section>"
  },
